## Attribution

This project is a clean-room OpenPress-native rewrite inspired by the
workflow and decision logic of `guizang-social-card-skill`
(https://github.com/op7418/guizang-social-card-skill).

As of 2026-05-27 the upstream switched to AGPL-3.0. This skill remains
under MIT because clean-room rewrite obligations only attach to derived
code, and no source code, CSS, HTML, or assets from the upstream were
copied into this repository. The design language studied (taste rules,
recipe taxonomy, type scale, identity tests, layered background system)
consists of factual / methodological ideas, which copyright does not
protect.

If verbatim porting of any upstream code becomes necessary in the future
— for example, to maintain compatibility with an upstream contract —
the affected files will carry per-file AGPL notices and be excluded
from the MIT scope. Until then, the MIT license above applies to all
code written in this repository.
